---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About - AI + Bio" description="About this blog and its author">
  <div class="prose prose-gray mx-auto max-w-3xl dark:prose-invert lg:prose-lg">
    <!-- Chinese -->
    <div class="lang-zh">
      <h1>关于</h1>
      <p>欢迎来到 <strong>AI + Bio</strong> —— 一个人工智能与生物学交叉领域的个人博客。</p>

      <h2>写作主题</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>深度学习在蛋白质结构预测与设计中的应用</li>
        <li>基因组序列模型与 DNA 语言模型</li>
        <li>单细胞组学的机器学习分析</li>
        <li>药物发现与分子表征学习</li>
        <li>计算生物学工具、论文解读与教程</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>关于我</h2>
      <p>我是一名工作在机器学习与计算生物学边界的研究者。这个博客是分享想法、论文笔记和技术探索的空间。</p>
      <p>欢迎通过 <a href="https://github.com/sfwang-auto">GitHub</a> 联系我。</p>
    </div>

    <!-- English -->
    <div class="lang-en">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p>Welcome to <strong>AI + Bio</strong> — a personal blog at the intersection of artificial intelligence and biology.</p>

      <h2>What I write about</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Deep learning for protein structure prediction and design</li>
        <li>Genomic sequence models and language models for DNA</li>
        <li>Single-cell omics analysis with machine learning</li>
        <li>Drug discovery and molecular representation learning</li>
        <li>Tools, papers, and tutorials in computational biology</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>About me</h2>
      <p>I'm a researcher working at the boundary of machine learning and computational biology. This blog is a space for sharing ideas, paper notes, and technical explorations.</p>
      <p>Feel free to reach out via <a href="https://github.com/sfwang-auto">GitHub</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
